DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
28224::$$$message_0207_0000_0000$$$::I don't go to anyone's room. I'm not going to sleep yet either, so I decide to take it easy in the living room.[lr]::
28225::$$$message_0207_0000_0001$$$::I watch TV for an hour without any particular goal in mind.[lr]::
28226::$$$message_0207_0000_0002$$$::[se volume=40 storage=se188.wav]I hear soft footsteps, then the door behind me slides open a sliver.::
28227::$$$message_0207_0001_0000$$$::"I've finished taking a bath. Would you like to use it now, Shirou?"[lr]::
28228::$$$message_0207_0001_0001$$$::"Nah, I'll go last.[lr]::
28229::$$$message_0207_0001_0002$$$::This special just started, and I'd have to heat it up again if I went now."[lr]::
28230::$$$message_0207_0001_0003$$$::"I see. I'll let the others know."::
28231::$$$message_0207_0002_0000$$$::The door slides shut.[lr]::
28232::$$$message_0207_0002_0001$$$::A refreshing yuzu aroma lingers in the air.[lr]::
28233::$$$message_0207_0002_0002$$$::I only got a glimpse of her, but Saber wearing her hair down always startles me.::
28234::$$$message_0207_0003_0000$$$::"...Weird. What am I thinking?"[lr]::
28235::$$$message_0207_0003_0001$$$::I notice myself getting very drowsy as I watch TV.[lr]::
28236::$$$message_0207_0003_0002$$$::As a result, my mind drifts...::
28237::$$$message_0207_0004_0000$$$::"...Hm."[lr]::
28238::$$$message_0207_0004_0001$$$::While I space out, the cat lounging on the floor stops kicking its feet.[lr]::
28239::$$$message_0207_0004_0002$$$::She glares at me, as if sensing my impure thoughts.::
28240::$$$message_0207_0005_0000$$$::"Wanna go in together, Big Brother?"[lr]::
28241::$$$message_0207_0005_0001$$$::"The toilet? Well, if you need it."[lr]::
28242::$$$message_0207_0005_0002$$$::I stand up.[lr]::
28243::$$$message_0207_0005_0003$$$::"Not that."[lr]::
28244::$$$message_0207_0005_0004$$$::"I figured. I would've been in a pickle if you actually said yes."::
28245::$$$message_0207_0006_0000$$$::I laugh it off.[lr]::
28246::$$$message_0207_0006_0001$$$::Arrgh, this drowsiness is scaring me. It's making everything hazy.[lr]::
28247::$$$message_0207_0006_0002$$$::The lightness of this footwork is night and day compared to my usual self.::
28248::$$$message_0207_0007_0000$$$::"I'm talking about taking a [font italic=true]bath[font italic=false] together. B-a-t-h. Let's do it if you have free time."[lr]::
28249::$$$message_0207_0007_0001$$$::Illya tugs on my sleeve.[lr]::
28250::$$$message_0207_0007_0002$$$::She makes me stop lazing around on the floor.::
28251::$$$message_0207_0008_0000$$$::"All right, Illya. You asked for it.[lr]::
28252::$$$message_0207_0008_0001$$$::If we take a bath together, I'll make you sit in the water up to your shoulders and count to one."[lr]::
28253::$$$message_0207_0008_0002$$$::"One? Only one? I'll catch a cold, though."[lr]::
28254::$$$message_0207_0008_0003$$$::"Then take a bath by yourself."::
28255::$$$message_0207_0009_0000$$$::"I need someone with me to tell me how a Japanese badezimmer works."[lr]::
28256::$$$message_0207_0009_0001$$$::"I like you when you don't take baths, Illya."[lr]::
28257::$$$message_0207_0009_0002$$$::"And I don't like you when you're like this, Shirou."::
28258::$$$message_0207_0010_0000$$$::"Ah, hey kids.[lr]::
28259::$$$message_0207_0010_0001$$$::What's all this? This sweet field?[lr]::
28260::$$$message_0207_0010_0002$$$::My patience (saving throw against petrification) has limits.[lr]::
28261::$$$message_0207_0010_0003$$$::Mm, try to save the oblivious conversations for the second after-party."[lr]::
28262::$$$message_0207_0010_0004$$$::She strikes a teacherly pose.::
28263::$$$message_0207_0011_0000$$$::Fuji-nee wasted no time eating dinner, jumping into the bath, and cracking open a cold beer.[lr]::
28264::$$$message_0207_0011_0001$$$::Who does she think she is?[lr]::
28265::$$$message_0207_0011_0002$$$::I wish she wouldn't spoil the quiet end of my day after doing laundry for six.::
28266::$$$message_0207_0012_0000$$$::"Illya? You can stay over, but take a bath by yourself. If you go in with someone else, don't ask them for help! Especially not a boy..."[lr]::
28267::$$$message_0207_0012_0001$$$::"Oh, is that how it is?[lr]::
28268::$$$message_0207_0012_0002$$$::Taiga's feeling insecure because she's never taken a bath with you. Right, Big Brother?"::
28269::$$$message_0207_0013_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28270::$$$message_0207_0013_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
28271::$$$message_0207_0013_0002$$$::"...Huh? Eh? Wait, what...?"::
28272::$$$message_0207_0014_0000$$$::"T-tears? Are you crying, Shirou?[lr]::
28273::$$$message_0207_0014_0001$$$::Taiga, why are you messing with the remote while humming?"[lr]::
28274::$$$message_0207_0014_0002$$$::"Uu...uuu...."[lr]::
28275::$$$message_0207_0014_0003$$$::"Aww, look what you did, dumping concrete on the easy family atmosphere."::
28276::$$$message_0207_0015_0000$$$::"S-sorry. I'm sorry, okay?[lr]::
28277::$$$message_0207_0015_0001$$$::I accidentally committed some domestic violence on your PTSD zone.[lr]::
28278::$$$message_0207_0015_0002$$$::I'm really sorry! Please forgive silly Illya!"::
28279::$$$message_0207_0016_0000$$$::"...'Gimme back my sponge.'"[lr]::
28280::$$$message_0207_0016_0001$$$::"...Hah!?"[lr]::
28281::$$$message_0207_0016_0002$$$::"...'Huh? I can't grab it. That's weird.'[lr]::
28282::$$$message_0207_0016_0003$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤fd特殊02b(中)]...'Whoa, whoa, whoa!'"::
28283::$$$message_0207_0017_0000$$$::"Uuuuu.... uuuuuu..."::
28284::$$$message_0207_0018_0000$$$::"Wha...[lr]::
28285::$$$message_0207_0018_0001$$$::What have you done to Shirou, Taiga!?"::
28286::$$$message_0207_0019_0000$$$::But I digress.::
28287::$$$message_0207_0020_0000$$$::"I cut some pears that Ryudou Temple shared with us.[lr]::
28288::$$$message_0207_0020_0001$$$::Would you all like some?"[lr]::
28289::$$$message_0207_0020_0002$$$::"Ooh, ooh! Beer and pears!"[lr]::
28290::$$$message_0207_0020_0003$$$::"Wait, really? Nice, how thoughtful of him."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤04a(遠)]::
28291::$$$message_0207_0021_0000$$$::"Oh, Rin.[lr]::
28292::$$$message_0207_0021_0001$$$::...You're back, how neglectful of me. I'll peel another right away."[lr]::
28293::$$$message_0207_0021_0002$$$::"No worries. Just bring it over here, Saber."[lr]::
28294::$$$message_0207_0021_0003$$$::"Are you sure, but I only count one, two, three..."::
28295::$$$message_0207_0022_0000$$$::"How many pieces do you intend to make each of us eat?[lr]::
28296::$$$message_0207_0022_0001$$$::It's fine. I'll take two or three slices. That's plenty to help me get into the spirit of Japanese autumn."[lr]::
28297::$$$message_0207_0022_0002$$$::"People say that we don't need to worry about calories from fruit..."::
28298::$$$message_0207_0023_0000$$$::"I never minded that to begin with. Counting calories is the most boorish thing one can do when consuming Japanese seasonal foods."::
28299::$$$message_0207_0024_0000$$$::"Well said! All we need now is some Pacific saury![lr]::
28300::$$$message_0207_0024_0001$$$::Shirou, bring us the fish! Huh?"[lr]::
28301::$$$message_0207_0024_0002$$$::"Ms. Fujimura, didn't you already have dinner?"::
28302::$$$message_0207_0025_0000$$$::"How long are you going to keep crying over spilled milk?[lr]::
28303::$$$message_0207_0025_0001$$$::Eat some pear and cheer up."[lr]::
28304::$$$message_0207_0025_0002$$$::"See, Big Brother?[lr]::
28305::$$$message_0207_0025_0003$$$::Saber's worried about you, too."::
28306::$$$message_0207_0026_0000$$$::"...R-right. Yeah. I can't just keep moping. It's bothering everyone."[lr]::
28307::$$$message_0207_0026_0001$$$::"I think Saber's the only one who's worried, though.[lr]::
28308::$$$message_0207_0026_0002$$$::Oh, she's already eating. [cacheimage storage=イリヤ03a(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ03a(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=446 top=0 time=300 accel=3 storage=イリヤ03a(近)]I want some, too!"[lr]::
28309::$$$message_0207_0026_0003$$$::"..."::
28310::$$$message_0207_0027_0000$$$::"What in the world is happening? (munch)"[lr]::
28311::$$$message_0207_0027_0001$$$::"Muoh, muoh, muoh, [cacheimage storage=藤06a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤06a(中)]pears are the best!"[lr]::
28312::$$$message_0207_0027_0002$$$::"What about Rider?"[lr]::
28313::$$$message_0207_0027_0003$$$::"Reading is apparently a staple of autumn. [cacheimage storage=桜私服03b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服03b(中)]Lately, all she's been doing is reading."[lr]::
28314::$$$message_0207_0027_0004$$$::"Huh. That is very autumn-y and elegant. (crunch)"[lr]::
28315::$$$message_0207_0027_0005$$$::"Yes. I'll bring some more after this."::
28316::$$$message_0207_0028_0000$$$::Tohsaka must have really been homesick. She's way past the two or three slices she said she'd eat.[lr]::
28317::$$$message_0207_0028_0001$$$::Next to her, Saber anxiously watches the plate, counting down the pear slices.::
28318::$$$message_0207_0029_0000$$$::"B-by the way, Rin...[lr]::
28319::$$$message_0207_0029_0001$$$::What was it like living in London?"[lr]::
28320::$$$message_0207_0029_0002$$$::"Oh yeah, you stayed in a dorm, right?"[lr]::
28321::$$$message_0207_0029_0003$$$::"...Haaah. I got into a bunch of trouble and ended up having to rent an apartment."::
28322::$$$message_0207_0030_0000$$$::"Wait, you have to live alone already? [cacheimage storage=藤08e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤08e(中) last=藤fd特殊02a(中)]Isn't that a little dangerous, Miss Tohsaka?"[lr]::
28323::$$$message_0207_0030_0001$$$::"Not especially. I was introduced to a trustworthy landlord ahead of time. It's in a safe area, too."[lr]::
28324::$$$message_0207_0030_0002$$$::"So you were relatively free to spend your time as you wished away from the dormitory?"::
28325::$$$message_0207_0031_0000$$$::"Nah, no way. Transfer students don't really have any free time, even short-term ones.[lr]::
28326::$$$message_0207_0031_0001$$$::I had to cook for myself in the apartment, so it was a real hassle."[lr]::
28327::$$$message_0207_0031_0002$$$::"You had to cook? Oh, I see.[lr]::
28328::$$$message_0207_0031_0003$$$::You avoided eating out to save money. How very like you."::
28329::$$$message_0207_0032_0000$$$::"Rin, I don't think Saber's interested in your school. She probably just wants to know if you ate any famous foods in London."[lr]::
28330::$$$message_0207_0032_0001$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
28331::$$$message_0207_0032_0002$$$::"Urgh... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服07c汗(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 textoff=0 storage=セイバー私服07c汗(中)]F-food and shelter are a fundamental step to learning the lay of the land."[lr]::
28332::$$$message_0207_0032_0003$$$::"Famous foods...[cacheimage storage=凛私服09c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服09c(中)]..."::
28333::$$$message_0207_0033_0000$$$::"It must be hard to do any housework when you're tired all the time. It could be worth eating out just to save you the stress."[lr]::
28334::$$$message_0207_0033_0001$$$::"I did, of course. At first, anyway."[lr]::
28335::$$$message_0207_0033_0002$$$::"Oh? Please, tell us more. Since it's fundamental information."[wm canskip=0]::
28336::$$$message_0207_0034_0000$$$::"On that note, what about the rumor? Is it true?"[lr]::
28337::$$$message_0207_0034_0001$$$::"Ah...that."[lr]::
28338::$$$message_0207_0034_0002$$$::"...Rumor? What rumor?"::
28339::$$$message_0207_0035_0000$$$::"Ahahaha, I'm pretty sure she's referring to the idea...[lr]::
28340::$$$message_0207_0035_0001$$$::that London has the worst food in the world..."[lr]::
28341::$$$message_0207_0035_0002$$$::"Yeah, that."[lr]::
28342::$$$message_0207_0035_0003$$$::"...! H-how disgraceful..."[lr]::
28343::$$$message_0207_0035_0004$$$::"I couldn't agree more. But think about it."::
28344::$$$message_0207_0036_0000$$$::"London's a big place.[lr]::
28345::$$$message_0207_0036_0001$$$::There might be places that make bad food to shock tourists, but locals wouldn't stand for it if their everyday food was inedible, right?[lr]::
28346::$$$message_0207_0036_0002$$$::So it really is nothing but a rumor."::
28347::$$$message_0207_0037_0000$$$::"I see. That does make sense."[lr]::
28348::$$$message_0207_0037_0001$$$::"Huh, really..."::
28349::$$$message_0207_0038_0000$$$::"...Or so..."[lr]::
28350::$$$message_0207_0038_0001$$$::"So?"::
28351::$$$message_0207_0039_0000$$$::"Or so I [wvl][se storage=se072.wav]thought![lr]::
28352::$$$message_0207_0039_0001$$$::Until I actually [font italic=true]lived[font italic=false] there!"[lr]::
28353::$$$message_0207_0039_0002$$$::THONK![lr]::
28354::$$$message_0207_0039_0003$$$::She slams her fists on the table, launching plates, pears, and forks into the air.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
28355::$$$message_0207_0040_0000$$$::"Bad... [cacheimage storage=凛私服16a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服16a(近)]Bad... [cacheimage storage=凛私服16e(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服16e(近)][lquake storage=凛私服16e(近) vmax=8 hmax=8]Bad...![wait canskip=0 time=500][lr]::
28356::$$$message_0207_0040_0001$$$::Bad doesn't even begin to describe it![lr]::
28357::$$$message_0207_0040_0002$$$::It's like consuming fuel! [cacheimage storage=凛私服06a(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服06a(近)]I'm talking literal gasoline![lr]::
28358::$$$message_0207_0040_0003$$$::They'll eat anything as long as they can digest it! [cacheimage storage=凛私服07b髪b(近),凛私服07b髪a(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服07b髪b(近)][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服07b髪a(近)]No, even that's giving them too much credit![lr]::
28359::$$$message_0207_0040_0004$$$::Those Londoners [wvl canskip=0 time=500][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4][se storage=se065.wav]lack the literal brain capacity [wvl canskip=0 time=500][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4][se storage=se065.wav]to make [wvl canskip=0 time=500][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4][se storage=se065.wav]their own [wvl canskip=0 time=500][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4][se storage=se065.wav]food [wvl canskip=0 time=500][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4][se storage=se065.wav]delicious [cacheimage storage=凛私服17a頬(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服17a頬(近)][shock vmax=40 time=300 count=-4][se storage=se082.wav]at all!"::
28360::$$$message_0207_0041_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28361::$$$message_0207_0041_0001$$$::Hmm. I wonder if that's really true.[lr]::
28362::$$$message_0207_0041_0002$$$::I don't think anyone like that actually exists.::
28363::$$$message_0207_0042_0000$$$::"But Tohsaka, aren't they famous over there for their fish and chips?[lr]::
28364::$$$message_0207_0042_0001$$$::And the fast food, like hamburgers, should at least taste fine, right?"[lr]::
28365::$$$message_0207_0042_0002$$$::"You're so open-minded, Emiya... [cacheimage storage=凛私服06g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服06g(中)]One question, though..."::
28366::$$$message_0207_0043_0000$$$::"Are you telling me to eat deep-fried whitefish three meals a day!?[lr]::
28367::$$$message_0207_0043_0001$$$::With mountains of fries!?[lr]::
28368::$$$message_0207_0043_0002$$$::I'd need cola to wash down all that [wvl][se storage=se230.wav]junk food, too!"[rf]::
28369::$$$message_0207_0044_0000$$$::Our living room [se storage=se044.wav]is rocked by a [se storage=se072.wav]violent tremor.[se storage=se079.wav][lr]::
28370::$$$message_0207_0044_0001$$$::Then, casually and boldly, the red lady from London reaches for an oddly colored can.::
28371::$$$message_0207_0045_0000$$$::"Aaaah, no, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]you can't, Miss Tohsaka![lr]::
28372::$$$message_0207_0045_0001$$$::That's beer... I mean, not beer, but it is a strangely colored, oddly flavored, imported soft drink from my personal collection!"[lr]::
28373::$$$message_0207_0045_0002$$$::"What does that even mean..."::
28374::$$$message_0207_0046_0000$$$::"...Puaah![lr]::
28375::$$$message_0207_0046_0001$$$::Ooooh, the rumors were true...![lr]::
28376::$$$message_0207_0046_0002$$$::Who in the world brutalized that country's food culture this badly!?"::
28377::$$$message_0207_0047_0000$$$::"You probably won't find many people who know."[lr]::
28378::$$$message_0207_0047_0001$$$::Glaring around the room, Tohsaka searches for a target of her bloodlust until her sunken eyes settle on our bona fide English person.[wm canskip=0]::
28379::$$$message_0207_0048_0000$$$::"IT WAS YOUUUUUU!"[lr]::
28380::$$$message_0207_0048_0001$$$::Saber is the focus of her rage.[lr]::
28381::$$$message_0207_0048_0002$$$::"Huh!?[lr]::
28382::$$$message_0207_0048_0003$$$::I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I don't know what I did wrong, but please forgive me!"[lr]::
28383::$$$message_0207_0048_0004$$$::Saber confesses to sins she never committed.::
28384::$$$message_0207_0049_0000$$$::"...You were that happy to come home, I see."[lr]::
28385::$$$message_0207_0049_0001$$$::Her little sister is mysteriously moved to tears.::
28386::$$$message_0207_0050_0000$$$::"Silly Rin. You reap what you sow.[lr]::
28387::$$$message_0207_0050_0001$$$::Anyone would get stressed out traveling to another country without a personal chef."[lr]::
28388::$$$message_0207_0050_0002$$$::And the Einzbern princess casually talks like a rich girl.::
28389::$$$message_0207_0051_0000$$$::"Rin, please forgive me!"[lr]::
28390::$$$message_0207_0051_0001$$$::"Never! Someone needs to crack down on you English savages, or future generations will never forgive us![lr]::
28391::$$$message_0207_0051_0002$$$::Take this, and this, and this, you barbarian, reeee!"::
28392::$$$message_0207_0052_0000$$$::Tohsaka [se storage=se072.wav]becomes a food demon [se storage=se044.wav]and hurls herself at Saber.[se storage=se072.wav][lr]::
28393::$$$message_0207_0052_0001$$$::However, [se storage=se123.wav]the tables are [se storage=se132.wav]suddenly turned on her, [se storage=se152.wav][se storage=se155.wav][se storage=se231.wav]as she's caught in a joint lock [se storage=se232.wav]and pinned into a submission hold against her seat cushion.[lr]::
28394::$$$message_0207_0052_0002$$$::Still, she struggles in spite of her defeat, defending her righteous indignation as only Tohsaka can.::
28395::$$$message_0207_0053_0000$$$::"Well, [cacheimage storage=藤fd特殊02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3][chgfg textoff=0 pos=r time=200 storage=藤fd特殊02a(中)]ain't this getting fun? Good times."[lr]::
28396::$$$message_0207_0053_0001$$$::Meanwhile, my stress level is at an all-time high.::
28397::$$$message_0207_0054_0000$$$::"Shirou, your eyes look like the big Buddha's at the temple."[lr]::
28398::$$$message_0207_0054_0001$$$::"Mm, I sure do. Japanese food sure is wonderful."[lr]::
28399::$$$message_0207_0054_0002$$$::"Weirdo."[lr]::
28400::$$$message_0207_0054_0003$$$::Illya pulls the plate of pears in front of herself, then plops herself down in my lap.::
28401::$$$message_0207_0055_0000$$$::"H-hey, Illya!"[lr]::
28402::$$$message_0207_0055_0001$$$::"Big Brother? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ01f(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ01f(近)]Say 'ahhh.'"::
28403::$$$message_0207_0056_0000$$$::"...!"[lr]::
28404::$$$message_0207_0056_0001$$$::"...!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
28405::$$$message_0207_0056_0002$$$::"...!"[rf]::
28406::$$$message_0207_0057_0000$$$::"Repent! Repent, I say[line len=2][cacheimage storage=凛fd特殊03d頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][stoplquake layer=all][chgfg textoff=0 last=凛fd特殊04b(中) time=200 storage=凛fd特殊03d頬(中) top=80 left=230]Oro?"[lr]::
28407::$$$message_0207_0057_0001$$$::Saber abruptly sits up straight.::
28408::$$$message_0207_0058_0000$$$::"Hold it right there, Illyasviel."[lr]::
28409::$$$message_0207_0058_0001$$$::"Say 'ahhh.'"[lr]::
28410::$$$message_0207_0058_0002$$$::"A-ahhh..."[lr]::
28411::$$$message_0207_0058_0003$$$::Illya crams the pear into my half-open mouth.::
28412::$$$message_0207_0059_0000$$$::"What, Saber?"[lr]::
28413::$$$message_0207_0059_0001$$$::"My patience (saving throw against petrification) also has its limits."[lr]::
28414::$$$message_0207_0059_0002$$$::That was fast![lr]::
28415::$$$message_0207_0059_0003$$$::Sakura keeps sipping her tea with a downcast look.::
28416::$$$message_0207_0060_0000$$$::"...Yeah, I think our ceasefire agreement just crumbled."[lr]::
28417::$$$message_0207_0060_0001$$$::"With a crash."[lr]::
28418::$$$message_0207_0060_0002$$$::"Hang on, who collapsed a what now?"::
28419::$$$message_0207_0061_0000$$$::"Rin, your panties are on crooked."[lr]::
28420::$$$message_0207_0061_0001$$$::"What? You're kidding."[lr]::
28421::$$$message_0207_0061_0002$$$::"That isn't the problem here!"::
28422::$$$message_0207_0062_0000$$$::"Fight!"[lr]::
28423::$$$message_0207_0062_0001$$$::Fuji-nee clangs her disposable chopsticks on a plate.[lr]::
28424::$$$message_0207_0062_0002$$$::"Cha~ cha chacha cha-la-lachaa, cha[humming]"[lr]::
28425::$$$message_0207_0062_0003$$$::The tiger cheerfully breaks into an acapella melody, [stopmove][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤fd特殊02c(中) last=藤fd特殊03_左構えb(中)]completely unhinged by her beer.[lr]::
28426::$$$message_0207_0062_0004$$$::Meanwhile, Illya is still leaning back against me, stuffing pear slices into my mouth.::
28427::$$$message_0207_0063_0000$$$::"I'm not really bitter about not having my own route."::
28428::$$$message_0207_0064_0000$$$::"I still have a little sister's privilege of skinship.[lr]::
28429::$$$message_0207_0064_0001$$$::If anything, this is a necessary step to establish my big brother's identity."::
28430::$$$message_0207_0065_0000$$$::"I-identity...?[lr]::
28431::$$$message_0207_0065_0001$$$::An event like this is trivial to me."[lr]::
28432::$$$message_0207_0065_0002$$$::"Hmm? Is it, now?"::
28433::$$$message_0207_0066_0000$$$::"Then go ahead.[lr]::
28434::$$$message_0207_0066_0001$$$::Let it not be said that I'm narrow-minded."[lr]::
28435::$$$message_0207_0066_0002$$$::PING![lr]::
28436::$$$message_0207_0066_0003$$$::Saber's cowlick locks on to me.::
28437::$$$message_0207_0067_0000$$$::"Shirou. Stay right there. Move at your own risk."[lr]::
28438::$$$message_0207_0067_0001$$$::"Roger."[lr]::
28439::$$$message_0207_0067_0002$$$::Saber gulps, then begins slowly but steadily shuffling toward me.::
28440::$$$message_0207_0068_0000$$$::I sit still as I'm told, slack-legged.[lr]::
28441::$$$message_0207_0068_0001$$$::Saber shifts as if sliding something heavy out of the way, turns her back to me, lifts the hem of her skirt, and struggles to lean back in a half-sitting posture.[lr]::
28442::$$$message_0207_0068_0002$$$::Her butt approaches me.::
28443::$$$message_0207_0069_0000$$$::"Don't forget about the 'ahhh' at the end."[lr]::
28444::$$$message_0207_0069_0001$$$::"Ngh......[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4] Ah...!"[lr]::
28445::$$$message_0207_0069_0002$$$::Eventually, Saber can't take it anymore and scrambles to the opposite end of the room, covering her face.[lr]::
28446::$$$message_0207_0069_0003$$$::She sits against the wall, limbs splayed and shaking her head.::
28447::$$$message_0207_0070_0000$$$::"I can't. I'm not capable of such a syrup-drenched, vanilla sponge-like act of barbarism![lr]::
28448::$$$message_0207_0070_0001$$$::Please forgive me, Shirou!"[lr]::
28449::$$$message_0207_0070_0002$$$::"Hey, it's no big deal. You did your best. It moved me."::
28450::$$$message_0207_0071_0000$$$::"You're such a softie!"[lr]::
28451::$$$message_0207_0071_0001$$$::"Yeah, not enough [font italic=true]lovey-doveyness[font italic=false].[lr]::
28452::$$$message_0207_0071_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤fd特殊02c(中)]So, who's next? Wanna give it a shot, Sakura?"::
28453::$$$message_0207_0072_0000$$$::"Of course.[lr]::
28454::$$$message_0207_0072_0001$$$::I'll be fine. In both backstory and personality, I'm clearly the superior little sister."[lr]::
28455::$$$message_0207_0072_0002$$$::No sooner does Sakura say that than she sits next to me, her knees against mine.[lr]::
28456::$$$message_0207_0072_0003$$$::She turns to me, and in one shrewd motion, offers me a slice of pear.::
28457::$$$message_0207_0073_0000$$$::"Say 'ahhh.'"[lr]::
28458::$$$message_0207_0073_0001$$$::"A-ahhh...[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=4](munch, munch)"[lr]::
28459::$$$message_0207_0073_0002$$$::As the five women stare me down, I realize that I can't taste the pear at all.::
28460::$$$message_0207_0074_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28461::$$$message_0207_0074_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
28462::$$$message_0207_0074_0002$$$::"..."::
28463::$$$message_0207_0075_0000$$$::"How does it taste, Sen...[cacheimage storage=white,桜私服08a頬(近),いい背景][wvl][fadein textoff=0 time=300 rule=走る感じ(右から) storage=white][clfg][fg index=5000 pos=rc storage=桜私服08a頬(近)][movefg page=back textoff=0 opacity=255 time=600 pos=lc accel=-2 storage=桜私服08a頬(近)][fadein textoff=0 time=300 rule=走る感じ(右から) storage=いい背景 noclear=1] B-Brother?"[lr]::
28464::$$$message_0207_0075_0001$$$::"(cough) Brother!?"[lr]::
28465::$$$message_0207_0075_0002$$$::"Ahh... I'm afraid the answer escapes me, um..."::
28466::$$$message_0207_0076_0000$$$::"Might I offer an objective description of it?"[lr]::
28467::$$$message_0207_0076_0001$$$::"Yes, Minister of Foreign Affairs Tohsaka..."[lr]::
28468::$$$message_0207_0076_0002$$$::"To be perfectly honest...[wvl canskip=false time=1000] It's like giving your mom a free massage ticket on Mother's Day."::
28469::$$$message_0207_0077_0000$$$::"Tohsaka-senpai, you're awful!"[lr]::
28470::$$$message_0207_0077_0001$$$::Sakura buries her face in Saber's chest, weeping.::
28471::$$$message_0207_0078_0000$$$::"Rin. Back to London with you."[lr]::
28472::$$$message_0207_0078_0001$$$::"Whaaa!?"::
28473::$$$message_0207_0079_0000$$$::"I think that makes it clear.[lr]::
28474::$$$message_0207_0079_0001$$$::I'm the little sister of little sisters, the lion of lions, the queen[line len=2]no, the princess of sisters![lr]::
28475::$$$message_0207_0079_0002$$$::Which means... I can have him pamper me whenever I want, within the bounds of normal life!"::
28476::$$$message_0207_0080_0000$$$::"Right, [wvl][se storage=se222.wav][move textoff=0 time=200 path=(97,57,255)(110,24,255)(118,11,255) storage=イリヤfd特殊03a(中) accel=-4 spline=1][se storage=se084.wav][move textoff=0 time=250 path=(12,73,255)(95,73,255)(105,73,255)(115,73,0) storage=セイバー私服09a(中) accel=-2]Big Bro[line len=2][cacheimage storage=イリヤfd特殊03a(中),セイバー私服10b(中)][wait canskip=0 time=1000][se storage=se155.wav][se storage=se230.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=108 top=446 time=300 accel=0 storage=イリヤfd特殊03a(中)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=300 pos=c accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服10b(中)]Gurgh!"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=se075.wav][shock vmax=15 time=800 count=14][lr]::
28477::$$$message_0207_0080_0001$$$::Illya dives at me, but is caught in midair and yanked away.[chgfg textoff=0 time=100 opacity=0 storage=イリヤ09b(中) last=イリヤ11a(中)]::
28478::$$$message_0207_0081_0000$$$::"I will not abide that, Illyasviel."[lr]::
28479::$$$message_0207_0081_0001$$$::"(cough) (cough) [wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ10b(中) last=イリヤ09b(中)]Learn when to give up, Saber.[lr]::
28480::$$$message_0207_0081_0002$$$::You have no right to talk, when you have no idea what a little sister is!"::
28481::$$$message_0207_0082_0000$$$::"How impudent! Of course I know what it is like to be a younger sister![lr]::
28482::$$$message_0207_0082_0001$$$::A little sister am I, and I am a little sister.[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服12a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服12a(中)]Once upon a time... They even called me little sister-king!"::
28483::$$$message_0207_0083_0000$$$::"Not the little sister-princess?"[lr]::
28484::$$$message_0207_0083_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
28485::$$$message_0207_0083_0002$$$::Absurd titles aside, I believe Saber had a foster brother.[lr]::
28486::$$$message_0207_0083_0003$$$::Which would make her an actual little sister, right?::
28487::$$$message_0207_0084_0000$$$::"Wait a second![lr]::
28488::$$$message_0207_0084_0001$$$::I was the first person to ever refer to Senpai as something like 'Big Brother'!"[lr]::
28489::$$$message_0207_0084_0002$$$::"Huh? Were you?"::
28490::$$$message_0207_0085_0000$$$::"Huh... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]But... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]What about... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]That's..."[lr]::
28491::$$$message_0207_0085_0001$$$::"...I'm sorry, Sis. Is there something off about my backstory?"[lr]::
28492::$$$message_0207_0085_0002$$$::"Yaaaargh!"[lr]::
28493::$$$message_0207_0085_0003$$$::Tohsaka violently trembles, goosebumps breaking out all over her skin.::
28494::$$$message_0207_0086_0000$$$::"I'm the only one who gets to call you 'Sis,' too."[lr]::
28495::$$$message_0207_0086_0001$$$::"Aaauuuaaggh..."[lr]::
28496::$$$message_0207_0086_0002$$$::"Do you feel sick, Sis? [cacheimage storage=桜私服03a(中)][wvl][retainhaze][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服03a(中)]Silly Sis."[lr]::
28497::$$$message_0207_0086_0003$$$::"Yeeeeaaaaagh!"[lr]::
28498::$$$message_0207_0086_0004$$$::Sakura chases Tohsaka, who is squirming like an inchworm, to the edge of the hall.[lr]::
28499::$$$message_0207_0086_0005$$$::Sometimes, [se storage=se426.wav][se volume=70 storage=se356.wav]Sakura is the world's scariest person[se storage=se079.wav].[lr]::
28500::$$$message_0207_0086_0006$$$::The runner-up is Saber. Her living expenses are a thing of horror.::
28501::$$$message_0207_0087_0000$$$::"Okay, let's pull ourselves together. Playtime's over!"[lr]::
28502::$$$message_0207_0087_0001$$$::Hehehe.[lr]::
28503::$$$message_0207_0087_0002$$$::Does she really think things will be different now?::
28504::$$$message_0207_0088_0000$$$::"I know how you all feel.[lr]::
28505::$$$message_0207_0088_0001$$$::It's petty that none of us are willing to give up any ground, but I can't sleep at night leaving things halfway done like this.[lr]::
28506::$$$message_0207_0088_0002$$$::So..."::
28507::$$$message_0207_0089_0000$$$::"Tonight, we're holding the 1st Emiya Household Little Sister-King Cup event!"::
28508::$$$message_0207_0090_0000$$$::"As you wish."[lr]::
28509::$$$message_0207_0090_0001$$$::"Rah, rah!"[lr]::
28510::$$$message_0207_0090_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
28511::$$$message_0207_0090_0003$$$::"Teketen, teketen-ten-ten-ten-ten-ten[humming]"::
28512::$$$message_0207_0091_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28513::$$$message_0207_0091_0001$$$::Has the strangely colored juice from Fuji-nee's collection affected her too much, or have I started to have actual evil nightmares?[lr]::
28514::$$$message_0207_0091_0002$$$::Everyone in the living room is bizarrely excited for this.[lr]::
28515::$$$message_0207_0091_0003$$$::...Wait, the state of that table... W-what were they thinking, drinking that!?::
28516::$$$message_0207_0092_0000$$$::"Ladies and gentleman,[lr]::
28517::$$$message_0207_0092_0001$$$::I'm your emcee, Rin Tohsaka. We have Miss Taiga Fujimura here from the Fujimura Stable to offer her expert analysis.[lr]::
28518::$$$message_0207_0092_0002$$$::Thank you for coming today."[lr]::
28519::$$$message_0207_0092_0003$$$::"Thanks!"[lr]::
28520::$$$message_0207_0092_0004$$$::"Hold on, I just want to ask... Don't I get a say in any of this?"::
28521::$$$message_0207_0093_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
28522::$$$message_0207_0093_0001$$$::"Chanko?"::
28523::$$$message_0207_0094_0000$$$::"Oh, right. Of course.[lr]::
28524::$$$message_0207_0094_0001$$$::I'm sure that you'll make a wonderful choice and pick one of them. Okay, go ahead."[lr]::
28525::$$$message_0207_0094_0002$$$::"Go ahead?"::
28526::$$$message_0207_0095_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28527::$$$message_0207_0095_0001$$$::"......"[lr]::
28528::$$$message_0207_0095_0002$$$::"........."[lr]::
28529::$$$message_0207_0095_0003$$$::"...I'm sorry I asked."::
28530::$$$message_0207_0096_0000$$$::"Good thing you're a fast learner."[lr]::
28531::$$$message_0207_0096_0001$$$::"Teketen-ten-ten-ten-ten-ten[humming] Choyn-choyn[humming]"::
28532::$$$message_0207_0097_0000$$$::"Our first event is the 'Little Sisterly Episode'!"[lr]::
28533::$$$message_0207_0097_0001$$$::If you have a story to tell that can tug the heartstrings of all the big brothers in the nation, and prove you're a little sister, step right up!"::
28534::$$$message_0207_0098_0000$$$::"Yes, I have one.::
28535::$$$message_0207_0099_0000$$$::"I have an older brother who cared more about eating and sleeping than learning about the world around him.[lr]::
28536::$$$message_0207_0099_0001$$$::His name was Kay."::
28537::$$$message_0207_0100_0000$$$::"When we were older, I learned that I was adopted and that my brother was my stepbrother. But we were still siblings raised side by side.[lr]::
28538::$$$message_0207_0100_0001$$$::Before that revelation, I always believed that Kay was my true brother. We forged new bonds, and even though our positions changed, my love and respect for him has never diminished."::
28539::$$$message_0207_0101_0000$$$::"Hm, hm. A beautiful case of sibling love, if I say so myself."[lr]::
28540::$$$message_0207_0101_0001$$$::"So what kind of little brother were you?"[lr]::
28541::$$$message_0207_0101_0002$$$::"Hm? Little brother?"[lr]::
28542::$$$message_0207_0101_0003$$$::"I misspoke. What kind of little sister were you?"::
28543::$$$message_0207_0102_0000$$$::"I was my brother's squire."[lr]::
28544::$$$message_0207_0102_0001$$$::"Squire?[lr]::
28545::$$$message_0207_0102_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 fliplr=1 color=0xBB464646 textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ06a(中)]No wonder you nag so much, like Sella does."[lr]::
28546::$$$message_0207_0102_0003$$$::"Sella is much more obsessed with you than I am.[lr]::
28547::$$$message_0207_0102_0004$$$::Anyway..."::
28548::$$$message_0207_0103_0000$$$::"I was still young at the time...[lr]::
28549::$$$message_0207_0103_0001$$$::My brother and adoptive father trained me in the arts of war, as well as the principles of knighthood.[lr]::
28550::$$$message_0207_0103_0002$$$::Of course, whenever Kay was to go on an excursion, I would tend his horse and ready his arms and rations."::
28551::$$$message_0207_0104_0000$$$::"Which of you was better with a sword?"[lr]::
28552::$$$message_0207_0104_0001$$$::"Well...me."[lr]::
28553::$$$message_0207_0104_0002$$$::"Right?[lr]::
28554::$$$message_0207_0104_0003$$$::Thank goodness. If you told me there were swordsmen stronger than you all over the planet, I wouldn't know what to do with myself!"::
28555::$$$message_0207_0105_0000$$$::"So your brother was nothing special, then."[lr]::
28556::$$$message_0207_0105_0001$$$::"...But I never bested him in combat."[lr]::
28557::$$$message_0207_0105_0002$$$::"Huh, what do you mean?"::
28558::$$$message_0207_0106_0000$$$::"When we dueled with practice swords, it always ended in verbal arguments. And when we faced each other in competitions, even if I bested him, I was never formally recognized as the winner by him.[lr]::
28559::$$$message_0207_0106_0001$$$::[chgfg mono=1 fliplr=0 color=0xBB464646 time=300 storage=藤02a腕a(中)]Not once did I ever have a clear victory where I could shout in joy."::
28560::$$$message_0207_0107_0000$$$::"Like telling you that you lost because you threw away your sheath or that you shouldn't consider it a win since you didn't finish him off?"[lr]::
28561::$$$message_0207_0107_0001$$$::"That was only the beginning of it.[lr]::
28562::$$$message_0207_0107_0002$$$::"...Uh-huh. You really were at odds with each other."::
28563::$$$message_0207_0108_0000$$$::"No one could beat my brother in debate.[lr]::
28564::$$$message_0207_0108_0001$$$::He's the most articulate knight I know."[lr]::
28565::$$$message_0207_0108_0002$$$::"Is that supposed to impress us?"[lr]::
28566::$$$message_0207_0108_0003$$$::"...Ahaha. I'm getting déjà vu, somehow."[lr]::
28567::$$$message_0207_0108_0004$$$::"Me too. Does he have curly hair?"[lr]::
28568::$$$message_0207_0108_0005$$$::"I see. You picked up your eloquence from your brother."::
28569::$$$message_0207_0109_0000$$$::"No, I can't even compare to him.[lr]::
28570::$$$message_0207_0109_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 fliplr=1 color=0xBB464646 time=200 storage=桜私服08a(中)]Sir Kay was so talkative that people said even a fire drake would flee from his rhetoric."[lr]::
28571::$$$message_0207_0109_0002$$$::"...Yeah. Good thing he didn't rub off on you too much, then."::
28572::$$$message_0207_0110_0000$$$::"What are you saying, Shirou?[lr]::
28573::$$$message_0207_0110_0001$$$::Such talents are indispensable in politics, as I would later learn to my great regret.[lr]::
28574::$$$message_0207_0110_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 fliplr=0 color=0xBB464646 time=300 storage=藤02a腕a(中)]He only ever gave me his most candid counsel."::
28575::$$$message_0207_0111_0000$$$::"He didn't let it get to his head, then."[lr]::
28576::$$$message_0207_0111_0001$$$::"Correct.[lr]::
28577::$$$message_0207_0111_0002$$$::I was never much good at the minutiae of military logistics.[lr]::
28578::$$$message_0207_0111_0003$$$::But he missed no detail. Not even a single tent stake was unaccounted for under his watch.[lr]::
28579::$$$message_0207_0111_0004$$$::Sir Kay is the only man whom I would place my full trust in to command a rear guard."::
28580::$$$message_0207_0112_0000$$$::"So he's foul-mouthed, cheap, and weak to boot."[lr]::
28581::$$$message_0207_0112_0001$$$::"No, Illyasviel.[lr]::
28582::$$$message_0207_0112_0002$$$::He was eloquent, an excellent governor, and had a strong understanding of his own capabilities!"[lr]::
28583::$$$message_0207_0112_0003$$$::"Aren't you lying through your teeth?"[lr]::
28584::$$$message_0207_0112_0004$$$::"Where might is the master, justice is its servant."[lr]::
28585::$$$message_0207_0112_0005$$$::Rin whispers into Saber's ear.::
28586::$$$message_0207_0113_0000$$$::"Hey, did Kay know you were a girl?"[lr]::
28587::$$$message_0207_0113_0001$$$::"Of course. We ate and slept together.[lr]::
28588::$$$message_0207_0113_0002$$$::But Merlin sternly warned him not to tell anyone, and he kept the secret for the rest of his life."::
28589::$$$message_0207_0114_0000$$$::"Though, there was just one time when Kay...[lr]::
28590::$$$message_0207_0114_0001$$$::I mean, my brother...[lr]::
28591::$$$message_0207_0114_0002$$$::was taking care of me when I was ill with a cold..."::
28592::$$$message_0207_0115_0000$$$::"Gah."::
28593::$$$message_0207_0116_0000$$$::"It's a nursing event!"[lr]::
28594::$$$message_0207_0116_0001$$$::[se volume=40 storage=se075.wav]The girls huddle around Saber.[lr]::
28595::$$$message_0207_0116_0002$$$::What is this feeling of alienation?::
28596::$$$message_0207_0117_0000$$$::"Our mother was out of the house, and it was raining, so my brother and I were alone together."[lr]::
28597::$$$message_0207_0117_0001$$$::"And?"[lr]::
28598::$$$message_0207_0117_0002$$$::"Go on."::
28599::$$$message_0207_0118_0000$$$::"He did something dirty, right?"[lr]::
28600::$$$message_0207_0118_0001$$$::"Huh?"::
28601::$$$message_0207_0119_0000$$$::"What sort of behavior do you mean?"[lr]::
28602::$$$message_0207_0119_0001$$$::"U-um...like a kiss."[lr]::
28603::$$$message_0207_0119_0002$$$::"I see.[lr]::
28604::$$$message_0207_0119_0003$$$::If I asked him that, he would probably tell me that the kiss of a caterpillar would make me feel better."[lr]::
28605::$$$message_0207_0119_0004$$$::"...Oh. I think I have an idea of what he was like now."::
28606::$$$message_0207_0120_0000$$$::"Kay said this: [lr]::
28607::$$$message_0207_0120_0001$$$::'If you die now, it'll be all kinds of trouble for me.[lr]::
28608::$$$message_0207_0120_0002$$$::So hurry up and get better. In return, I'll do anything you want today.'"::
28609::$$$message_0207_0121_0000$$$::"I told him there was nothing I wanted, but he was insistent, so I told him that I wanted to have a dream.[lr]::
28610::$$$message_0207_0121_0001$$$::A dream of a lion running in a meadow..."[lr]::
28611::$$$message_0207_0121_0002$$$::"That's a big ask."::
28612::$$$message_0207_0122_0000$$$::"But my brother just said, 'all right,' and left the room."::
28613::$$$message_0207_0123_0000$$$::"The next day, I found a handcarved wooden doll under my pillow.[lr]::
28614::$$$message_0207_0123_0001$$$::It looked more like a cross between a cat and dog than a lion, but it made me very happy."::
28615::$$$message_0207_0124_0000$$$::"Once I got better, I made sure to thank my brother.[lr]::
28616::$$$message_0207_0124_0001$$$::I told him that I got to see that dream, thanks to him."::
28617::$$$message_0207_0125_0000$$$::"By the way, he reacted with extreme skepticism.[lr]::
28618::$$$message_0207_0125_0001$$$::I was worried that my clumsy flattery angered him, but he was more shocked by his own wood carving."::
28619::$$$message_0207_0126_0000$$$::"He said this, sadly: [lr]::
28620::$$$message_0207_0126_0001$$$::'There's no way. The lion I carved couldn't kill a mouse. It's an old lion that's about to kick the bucket.'"[lr]::
28621::$$$message_0207_0126_0002$$$::"Ahahahahaha!"[wvs][wm canskip=0][se volume=60 storage=se067.wav][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=3][lr]::
28622::$$$message_0207_0126_0003$$$::Tohsaka is rolling on the floor, clutching her stomach.[wshock canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 fliplr=1 color=0xBB464646 time=300 storage=イリヤ10a(中)] She's taking this with way too much good humor.::
28623::$$$message_0207_0127_0000$$$::"Was he afraid that the lion he carved might attack you in your dreams?"[lr]::
28624::$$$message_0207_0127_0001$$$::"Most likely."[lr]::
28625::$$$message_0207_0127_0002$$$::"Your brother sounds adorable."::
28626::$$$message_0207_0128_0000$$$::"Hee...hee...hilarious...[lr]::
28627::$$$message_0207_0128_0001$$$::S-Sakura? What should I carve you the next time you catch a cold? A dying cat? Or a pig?"[lr]::
28628::$$$message_0207_0128_0002$$$::"Carve yourself. (mumbling)"::
28629::$$$message_0207_0129_0000$$$::"H-hmph. I guess they couldn't even buy you a stuffed animal."[lr]::
28630::$$$message_0207_0129_0001$$$::"Yes. We were a family of knights who contented ourselves with honorable poverty."::
28631::$$$message_0207_0130_0000$$$::"Okay, I'll go next.[lr]::
28632::$$$message_0207_0130_0001$$$::This is about my brother, Shinji Matou."[wm canskip=0]::
28633::$$$message_0207_0131_0000$$$::"Oh, come on.[lr]::
28634::$$$message_0207_0131_0001$$$::I think I'm going to grind my molars down if I have to hear two or three of these moving tales in one day."[lr]::
28635::$$$message_0207_0131_0002$$$::Sakura looks at Rin with genuine bewilderment.::
28636::$$$message_0207_0132_0000$$$::"Moving...?"[lr]::
28637::$$$message_0207_0132_0001$$$::"...Never mind, sorry."::
28638::$$$message_0207_0133_0000$$$::And then...[lr]::
28639::$$$message_0207_0133_0001$$$::Sakura's story about her younger self and everyone's idol, Shinji, rages through the living room like a typhoon, and by the time she's done, everyone looks exhausted.[lr]::
28640::$$$message_0207_0133_0002$$$::I took relatively light damage after being desensitized to him daily, but it looks like it was a rather heavy story to everyone else.::
28641::$$$message_0207_0134_0000$$$::"Do you accept me now as the Lord of Sisters, who shows little sisters the true path of sisterhood?"::
28642::$$$message_0207_0135_0000$$$::"...Ieyasu Tokugawa just crossed my mind. Hisan Takechiyo."[lr]::
28643::$$$message_0207_0135_0001$$$::"I thought of the Hakkouda Mountains. Or going on a deathly ruck march through the snow."::
28644::$$$message_0207_0136_0000$$$::"I'm sorry, Sakura.[lr]::
28645::$$$message_0207_0136_0001$$$::I didn't notice that it turned into a millennial sob story."[lr]::
28646::$$$message_0207_0136_0002$$$::"It was my story, though."[lr]::
28647::$$$message_0207_0136_0003$$$::"..."::
28648::$$$message_0207_0137_0000$$$::"I'm looking forward to what Illya has to share. I hope it's a good, wholesome palate cleanser."[lr]::
28649::$$$message_0207_0137_0001$$$::"Yeah, of course."::
28650::$$$message_0207_0138_0000$$$::"I've always wanted to have [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06f(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ06f(中) last=イリヤ03b(中)]a big brother."::
28651::$$$message_0207_0139_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28652::$$$message_0207_0139_0001$$$::"..."::
28653::$$$message_0207_0140_0000$$$::"...That's all?"[lr]::
28654::$$$message_0207_0140_0001$$$::"...Y-yeah."::
28655::$$$message_0207_0141_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28656::$$$message_0207_0141_0001$$$::"..."::
28657::$$$message_0207_0142_0000$$$::"I declare the victor!"[lr]::
28658::$$$message_0207_0142_0001$$$::Rin waves the referee's fan and points it at Saber.::
28659::$$$message_0207_0143_0000$$$::"Saber!"[lr]::
28660::$$$message_0207_0143_0001$$$::She solemnly bows at the plate of pears Fuji-nee brought, and accepts it like a sumo champion.::
28661::$$$message_0207_0144_0000$$$::"See? I did it, Shirou!"[lr]::
28662::$$$message_0207_0144_0001$$$::"Great. Congrats, Saber."[lr]::
28663::$$$message_0207_0144_0002$$$::Also, you watch too much TV.::
28664::$$$message_0207_0145_0000$$$::"And the winning move was...[cacheimage storage=藤fd特殊02a(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤fd特殊02a(遠)] Hiki-otoshi, a frontal pull-down!"[lr]::
28665::$$$message_0207_0145_0001$$$::"What about me!?"[lr]::
28666::$$$message_0207_0145_0002$$$::"Hm? Why would the loser have a winning move?"[lr]::
28667::$$$message_0207_0145_0003$$$::"Illya used a kata-sukashi, a shoulder swing!"[lr]::
28668::$$$message_0207_0145_0004$$$::"Aww..."::
28669::$$$message_0207_0146_0000$$$::"...Can I ask what I did?"[lr]::
28670::$$$message_0207_0146_0001$$$::"Dark Sakura pulled off the opponent's loincloth! You're on the fast track to defeat!"[lr]::
28671::$$$message_0207_0146_0002$$$::"Th-that isn't a real [wvl][se storage=se226.wav]move[wvl][se storage=se226.wav]!"[lr]::
28672::$$$message_0207_0146_0003$$$::"Huh? It isn't?"::
28673::$$$message_0207_0147_0000$$$::"And so, the second day of the Emiya Household Little Sister-King Cup[lr]::
28674::$$$message_0207_0147_0001$$$::enters its second day!"[lr]::
28675::$$$message_0207_0147_0002$$$::"Chonmage!"[lr]::
28676::$$$message_0207_0147_0003$$$::"...Haah. Are we still dragging out this sumo joke?"[lr]::
28677::$$$message_0207_0147_0004$$$::"Dark Sakura..."::
28678::$$$message_0207_0148_0000$$$::"Okay, let's all have a change of pace.[lr]::
28679::$$$message_0207_0148_0001$$$::The next event is 'What I want to do/have done to me as a little sister'!"::
28680::$$$message_0207_0149_0000$$$::"Then I shall[line=len2][cacheimage storage=セイバー私服12c(中),桜私服05b(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=254 top=118 time=300 accel=0 storage=セイバー私服12c(中)][se volume=50 storage=se054.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=264 top=56 time=500 accel=-2 storage=桜私服05b(中)][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(271,95,255)(293,129,255)(317,189,0) storage=セイバー私服01c(中) accel=0 spline=1]hyah!"[se storage=se057.wav][lr]::
28681::$$$message_0207_0149_0001$$$::When Saber slowly starts to stand up, Sakura raps her behind the knees and steps forward.::
28682::$$$message_0207_0150_0000$$$::"The results weren't clear last time, and I still don't accept them."[lr]::
28683::$$$message_0207_0150_0001$$$::"A-all right, Sakura.[lr]::
28684::$$$message_0207_0150_0002$$$::L-[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Ladies first!"[lr]::
28685::$$$message_0207_0150_0003$$$::"I've got plenty of those, too!"::
28686::$$$message_0207_0151_0000$$$::We're now in a world where only the fittest survive, and the blood can only be washed out by the blood of little sisters.[lr]::
28687::$$$message_0207_0151_0001$$$::Saber looks dazed, like she's been hit by a spell.[lr]::
28688::$$$message_0207_0151_0002$$$::Maybe they hadn't discovered the knee-rap in her time.::
28689::$$$message_0207_0152_0000$$$::"If I had a respectable older brother, the thing I'd want to do is..."[lr]::
28690::$$$message_0207_0152_0001$$$::"Don't you already have a big brother [font italic=true]and[font italic=false] a big sister? (mumbling)"::
28691::$$$message_0207_0153_0000$$$::"Please be quiet, Tohsaka-senpai.[lr]::
28692::$$$message_0207_0153_0001$$$::The thing I'd want to offer my [font italic=true]respectable[font italic=false] big brother, even if it means erasing a wretched past, is...[lr]::
28693::$$$message_0207_0153_0002$$$::A short trip just before marriage."::
28694::$$$message_0207_0154_0000$$$::"Kuaaaagh![lr]::
28695::$$$message_0207_0154_0001$$$::There's another lawbreaker here!"[lr]::
28696::$$$message_0207_0154_0002$$$::"That just makes you sound like an animal.[lr]::
28697::$$$message_0207_0154_0003$$$::Do you even hear what you're saying, Sakura?"[lr]::
28698::$$$message_0207_0154_0004$$$::"Um, you're saying that you would like to travel privately with your brother before you're married off to another man?"::
28699::$$$message_0207_0155_0000$$$::"Exactly, Saber."[lr]::
28700::$$$message_0207_0155_0001$$$::Sakura looks through circles she made with the fingers of both hands.::
28701::$$$message_0207_0156_0000$$$::"On the trip, we'd have fun just like we did when we were kids...[lr]::
28702::$$$message_0207_0156_0001$$$::And on the last night, I would cuddle him from behind and whisper..."::
28703::$$$message_0207_0157_0000$$$::"I wish tomorrow would never come..."::
28704::$$$message_0207_0158_0000$$$::"I don't want to get married...[lr]::
28705::$$$message_0207_0158_0001$$$::I want to be your little sister forever."::
28706::$$$message_0207_0159_0000$$$::"Ooof, that cuts deep.[lr]::
28707::$$$message_0207_0159_0001$$$::I think I just shed a beer."[lr]::
28708::$$$message_0207_0159_0002$$$::"You mean 'tear,' Ms. Fujimura."::
28709::$$$message_0207_0160_0000$$$::"...And then, at the wedding, my brother would gallantly crash the wedding, take my hand, and ride off into the sunset to our 'graduation'! Tee-hee."[lr]::
28710::$$$message_0207_0160_0001$$$::"That's just shameless escapism! [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Call the cops!"::
28711::$$$message_0207_0161_0000$$$::"Oh, really? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08h(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ08h(中)]That's not allowed?"[lr]::
28712::$$$message_0207_0161_0001$$$::"...It wouldn't end well."::
28713::$$$message_0207_0162_0000$$$::"I understand. Family partings are painful, even when you know you can meet again someday."[lr]::
28714::$$$message_0207_0162_0001$$$::"It's more like breaking off relations in this case."[lr]::
28715::$$$message_0207_0162_0002$$$::"Eeheehee. [cacheimage storage=桜私服08c(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜私服08c(近)]Hmm-hmm~[humming]"::
28716::$$$message_0207_0163_0000$$$::"Mrgh... [cacheimage storage=藤fd特殊02b(遠)][wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3][chgfg time=200 storage=藤fd特殊02b(遠) last=藤08f(遠)]This is that famous jingle I've heard from Simon and Garfunkel![lr]::
28717::$$$message_0207_0163_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤02d腕c(遠) last=藤fd特殊02b(遠)]Ooogh, to be frank with you, I have traumatic memories of liberally translating this song when I was still a student teacher and turning it into a crazy joke...!"::
28718::$$$message_0207_0164_0000$$$::"That's hilarious, ma'am. [lr]::
28719::$$$message_0207_0164_0001$$$::Want to try going next, Illya?"::
28720::$$$message_0207_0165_0000$$$::"U-um, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ08g(中)]hold on.[lr]::
28721::$$$message_0207_0165_0001$$$::You can go first, Saber."[lr]::
28722::$$$message_0207_0165_0002$$$::"Very well. Then..."::
28723::$$$message_0207_0166_0000$$$::"If I was allowed to act as a little sister, then what I would have done is..."::
28724::$$$message_0207_0167_0000$$$::"Ask my brother to teach me to dance, I suppose."[lr]::
28725::$$$message_0207_0167_0001$$$::"Dance?"[lr]::
28726::$$$message_0207_0167_0002$$$::"Like a classic [font italic=true]kotenbuyo[font italic=false]? Huh, sounds interesting."[lr]::
28727::$$$message_0207_0167_0003$$$::"Kotenbuyo?"[lr]::
28728::$$$message_0207_0167_0004$$$::Dancing, of all things...[lr]::
28729::$$$message_0207_0167_0005$$$::Isn't that traumatic for the majority of young men?[lr]::
28730::$$$message_0207_0167_0006$$$::I just can't imagine anyone being Saber's escort at a ball.::
28731::$$$message_0207_0168_0000$$$::"So you're talking about...[lr]::
28732::$$$message_0207_0168_0001$$$::Wearing a satin dress and a white suit, and going to a fancy dance hall under a chandelier..."[lr]::
28733::$$$message_0207_0168_0002$$$::"You've got no imagination, Shirou. I'm embarrassed as your sister."::
28734::$$$message_0207_0169_0000$$$::"Sh-shut up. What's wrong with that? Guys have fantasies like this, too. Like...[lr]::
28735::$$$message_0207_0169_0001$$$::May I have this dance, Your Highness?"[lr]::
28736::$$$message_0207_0169_0002$$$::Saber takes my hand that I extended just as a joke.::
28737::$$$message_0207_0170_0000$$$::"Yes. I'd be happy to."[lr]::
28738::$$$message_0207_0170_0001$$$::She stands up and bows reverently.[lr]::
28739::$$$message_0207_0170_0002$$$::The others watch us with eagle eyes.[lr]::
28740::$$$message_0207_0170_0003$$$::I feel the heat rise to my ears. The momentary illusion of being in a ballroom sends my heart into overdrive.[lr]::
28741::$$$message_0207_0170_0004$$$::I even start to imagine the swaying melodies of the orchestra.::
28742::$$$message_0207_0171_0000$$$::"U-um, Saber?"[lr]::
28743::$$$message_0207_0171_0001$$$::By the way, Saber's caught my arms in a fashion that looks exactly like a judo technique.[lr]::
28744::$$$message_0207_0171_0002$$$::"Hehe."[lr]::
28745::$$$message_0207_0171_0003$$$::"...Whoa!"[lr]::
28746::$$$message_0207_0171_0004$$$::She swings me, and I tumble onto the floor.::
28747::$$$message_0207_0172_0000$$$::"I don't know how to dance like a girl, you know."[lr]::
28748::$$$message_0207_0172_0001$$$::I stare up at her, my back on the ground.::
28749::$$$message_0207_0173_0000$$$::"I just want to add...[lr]::
28750::$$$message_0207_0173_0001$$$::My image of a dance involves sweet cocktails, or at least hors d'oeuvres."[lr]::
28751::$$$message_0207_0173_0002$$$::"In my case, there would be dark ale and thickly sliced meats."[lr]::
28752::$$$message_0207_0173_0003$$$::"In wooden flagons?"[lr]::
28753::$$$message_0207_0173_0004$$$::"Don't be silly. We'd drink straight from the cask!"::
28754::$$$message_0207_0174_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28755::$$$message_0207_0174_0001$$$::Um, Saber... Are you sure you weren't a Viking king?::
28756::$$$message_0207_0175_0000$$$::"Huh. That sounds nice, Saber. Like a festival."[lr]::
28757::$$$message_0207_0175_0001$$$::"That's exactly it. Boisterous merrymaking.[lr]::
28758::$$$message_0207_0175_0002$$$::What Shirou describes is a ball, a set of customs the upper classes refined and codified as an art form."::
28759::$$$message_0207_0176_0000$$$::"But in my land, dances were enjoyed by the common people.[lr]::
28760::$$$message_0207_0176_0001$$$::It was a vulgar form of amusement that those of high station hesitated to engage in."[lr]::
28761::$$$message_0207_0176_0002$$$::"So you can't actually dance?"[lr]::
28762::$$$message_0207_0176_0003$$$::"I'm modestly trained in some ritual sword dances, but they are ultimately rituals."::
28763::$$$message_0207_0177_0000$$$::"I can certainly dance the wild, amusing dance of the commoners, but..."[lr]::
28764::$$$message_0207_0177_0001$$$::"So it's like the bon dance we have at festivals here, right?[lr]::
28765::$$$message_0207_0177_0002$$$::Simple moves that anyone can pick up."[lr]::
28766::$$$message_0207_0177_0003$$$::"Bon dance?"::
28767::$$$message_0207_0178_0000$$$::"Ah, that dance performed at summer festivals.[lr]::
28768::$$$message_0207_0178_0001$$$::Yes. The tempo and intensity of the moves are different, but the harmonious nature of it is quite similar."::
28769::$$$message_0207_0179_0000$$$::"I noticed some excellent dancers among the crowd, too. I was enchanted by those girls' impressive footwork."[lr]::
28770::$$$message_0207_0179_0001$$$::"I guess it's like the moves that make the crowd squeal in tennis."::
28771::$$$message_0207_0180_0000$$$::"I'm sure it is.[lr]::
28772::$$$message_0207_0180_0001$$$::I think I would have greatly enjoyed learning to dance from my brother."::
28773::$$$message_0207_0181_0000$$$::"When you bring up tennis, I start to get the idea, but it's hard to imagine the emotion of it."[lr]::
28774::$$$message_0207_0181_0001$$$::"I dunno, I think it was a very Saber thing to say."[lr]::
28775::$$$message_0207_0181_0002$$$::"...Not like I can do either of them..."[lr]::
28776::$$$message_0207_0181_0003$$$::Fuji-nee's arms are folded, and she's making a bombastic show of looking impressed.::
28777::$$$message_0207_0182_0000$$$::"My opinion of England is on a roller-coaster ride today.[lr]::
28778::$$$message_0207_0182_0001$$$::Saber, was your hometown some undeveloped place on the frontier?[lr]::
28779::$$$message_0207_0182_0002$$$::Or one of those Amish communities?"::
28780::$$$message_0207_0183_0000$$$::"Um..."[lr]::
28781::$$$message_0207_0183_0001$$$::Saber looks to Tohsaka for help.::
28782::$$$message_0207_0184_0000$$$::"Something like that. [cacheimage storage=凛私服06e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服06e(中)]But dig too deep, and a bunch of scary people in black will come up to make you disappear."[lr]::
28783::$$$message_0207_0184_0001$$$::"Eeek! No thanks, I don't wanna deal with them!"[lr]::
28784::$$$message_0207_0184_0002$$$::"Wow, Ms. Fujimura. You've met them before?"[lr]::
28785::$$$message_0207_0184_0003$$$::Well, of course she has.[lr]::
28786::$$$message_0207_0184_0004$$$::She's only one step away from being a cryptid herself, you know.::
28787::$$$message_0207_0185_0000$$$::"Now, you've kept us waiting, Illyasviel."[lr]::
28788::$$$message_0207_0185_0001$$$::"Is it my turn? I thought of a whole bunch."::
28789::$$$message_0207_0186_0000$$$::"My big brother and I would go shopping, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ08g(中)]cook together while I snack on the food next to him, stay up late watching TV..."::
28790::$$$message_0207_0187_0000$$$::"...take walks in the park, he'd save me from a big dog when it got too frisky with me, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ06f(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ06f(中)]he'd come pick me up with an umbrella on a rainy day, [cacheimage storage=イリヤ08g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=イリヤ08g(中)]and, um..."::
28791::$$$message_0207_0188_0000$$$::"...Illya."[lr]::
28792::$$$message_0207_0188_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
28793::$$$message_0207_0188_0002$$$::"Aren't you already doing those things? Pretty much every day?"[lr]::
28794::$$$message_0207_0188_0003$$$::"Yeah? You jealous?"[lr]::
28795::$$$message_0207_0188_0004$$$::Illya proudly puffs up her chest.::
28796::$$$message_0207_0189_0000$$$::"Heh. Hehe. Hehehe. Heh.[lr]::
28797::$$$message_0207_0189_0001$$$::We have a winner![lr]::
28798::$$$message_0207_0189_0002$$$::Dark Sakuraaaa!"[lr]::
28799::$$$message_0207_0189_0003$$$::Tohsaka waves her fan again.::
28800::$$$message_0207_0190_0000$$$::"Thanks.[lr]::
28801::$$$message_0207_0190_0001$$$::But please stop adding 'Dark' before my real name."[lr]::
28802::$$$message_0207_0190_0002$$$::"Then, Shadow Sakura!"[lr]::
28803::$$$message_0207_0190_0003$$$::"Never mind, just go with 'Dark.'"::
28804::$$$message_0207_0191_0000$$$::"The winning move was an [font italic=true]abisetaoshi[font italic=false] push!"[lr]::
28805::$$$message_0207_0191_0001$$$::"Mrgh. Impressive, Sakura."::
28806::$$$message_0207_0192_0000$$$::"Now, both ozekis will face off in the final challenge of the day!"[lr]::
28807::$$$message_0207_0192_0001$$$::"...What about me?"::
28808::$$$message_0207_0193_0000$$$::"Illya doesn't seem to have any challengers![lr]::
28809::$$$message_0207_0193_0001$$$::I guess you're still on the level of a traveling boy rikishi who can't seem to win much in open sumo practice sessions?"[lr]::
28810::$$$message_0207_0193_0002$$$::"I'm not a rikishi!"::
28811::$$$message_0207_0194_0000$$$::"As a girl rikishi supporting the future of the Fujimura Stable, I expect you to display the mettle of a wrestler who hides weapons in his loincloth."[lr]::
28812::$$$message_0207_0194_0001$$$::"I'd never wear one!"[lr]::
28813::$$$message_0207_0194_0002$$$::"Pipe down and [cacheimage storage=藤fd特殊03_左構えb(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=95 top=61 time=200 accel=0 storage=藤fd特殊03_左構えb(中)][move textoff=0 time=200 path=(118,61,255)(92,61,255)(116,61,255)(99,61,255) storage=藤fd特殊03_左ジャブb(中) accel=0][move textoff=0 time=800 opacity=255 base=イリヤ07d(中) cx=120 storage=イリヤ07d(中) py=372 px=600 affine=(625,383,+0.0,1,255,120,228)(608,597,-3.945,1,255,83,427)(602,596,+0.0,1,255,88,432)(605,591,-3.814,1,255,83,420)(604,599,+0.0,1,255,88,435) cy=228 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=0]eat your chanko!"::
28814::$$$message_0207_0195_0000$$$::"Now...[lr]::
28815::$$$message_0207_0195_0001$$$::Each contender is fired up, but the final round will settle the score once and for all.[lr]::
28816::$$$message_0207_0195_0002$$$::It's the, uh, 'Little Sisterly Catchphrase'!"::
28817::$$$message_0207_0196_0000$$$::"Hm. Moe is the most promising energy source of the future![lr]::
28818::$$$message_0207_0196_0001$$$::Drive the adrenaline counter I hid in the subject's brain to its maximum value!"[lr]::
28819::$$$message_0207_0196_0002$$$::She implanted WHAT in my brain!?::
28820::$$$message_0207_0197_0000$$$::"Kh... This will be tough... I need to come up with a catchphrase that'll do a critical blow to Senpai, who's three times more dense than the average person..."[lr]::
28821::$$$message_0207_0197_0001$$$::"Huh? [cacheimage storage=イリヤ02a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ02a(中)]Hey, are catchphrases supposed to kill people?"[lr]::
28822::$$$message_0207_0197_0002$$$::"Sometimes, yes."[lr]::
28823::$$$message_0207_0197_0003$$$::Did you just say what you actually feel, Sakura...?::
28824::$$$message_0207_0198_0000$$$::"You've definitely got your work cut out for you.[lr]::
28825::$$$message_0207_0198_0001$$$::But the seek time ends here. First is... Let's start with Saber!"::
28826::$$$message_0207_0199_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28827::$$$message_0207_0199_0001$$$::Saber gets down on one knee, thinking. I see a drop of sweat on her forehead. One might say she's struggling with the question.[lr]::
28828::$$$message_0207_0199_0002$$$::She's probably going to take the serious approach.[lr]::
28829::$$$message_0207_0199_0003$$$::Suddenly, she opens her eyes wide.::
28830::$$$message_0207_0200_0000$$$::"I would draw on my knowledge as a king who is also a little sister to say..."::
28831::$$$message_0207_0201_0000$$$::"'Oh, Brother. You're so hopeless.'[lr]::
28832::$$$message_0207_0201_0001$$$::How about that!"::
28833::$$$message_0207_0202_0000$$$::"Oooof! Oh no, I might die![lr]::
28834::$$$message_0207_0202_0001$$$::She even said it in character! What do you think, boss!?"[lr]::
28835::$$$message_0207_0202_0002$$$::"Well...[lr]::
28836::$$$message_0207_0202_0003$$$::The way she opened with faint scorn, only to hammer in her hidden love could force her brother to the edge of the sumo ring in one move.[lr]::
28837::$$$message_0207_0202_0004$$$::It was a stable, well-executed technique."::
28838::$$$message_0207_0203_0000$$$::"I see.[lr]::
28839::$$$message_0207_0203_0001$$$::Leaving our star performer Illya aside, that makes Sakura next?"[lr]::
28840::$$$message_0207_0203_0002$$$::"I know I'm just an opening act, like sashimi garnish. A commercial in the middle of a baseball game. The stain below a piece of furniture. Hello, I'm Sakura."::
28841::$$$message_0207_0204_0000$$$::"I... I think that being a real little sister or the ultimate little sister are both great things. You don't have to try to be everything at once.[lr]::
28842::$$$message_0207_0204_0001$$$::As long as you can be someone's one and only little sister."[lr]::
28843::$$$message_0207_0204_0002$$$::"Yeah, that's why I[line len=2]"[lr]::
28844::$$$message_0207_0204_0003$$$::"If I had a big brother like no other who could make me forget my entire past, I'd say...::
28845::$$$message_0207_0205_0000$$$::"'You don't have to cry. There's nothing to be scared of. You don't have to run.[lr]::
28846::$$$message_0207_0205_0001$$$:: I promise you, I'll always be by your side.'"::
28847::$$$message_0207_0206_0000$$$::"Hnnngh, that hit different, hnngh![lr]::
28848::$$$message_0207_0206_0001$$$::Terrifying! Absolutely fearsome! Let's hear your thoughts, boss!"::
28849::$$$message_0207_0207_0000$$$::"Wow, that was magnificent. It was an assault worthy of super-heavyweights.[lr]::
28850::$$$message_0207_0207_0001$$$::It seized the opponent's outstretched hand in an inescapable lock and dragged them out of the ring."[lr]::
28851::$$$message_0207_0207_0002$$$::"Also, there was zero need for the haiku meter."[lr]::
28852::$$$message_0207_0207_0003$$$::"Hehe, just couldn't help myself. (heart)"::
28853::$$$message_0207_0208_0000$$$::"Haah, haah... It's getting hard to breathe after so many explosive incantations, but I will do my duty as the emcee.[lr]::
28854::$$$message_0207_0208_0001$$$::Okay, the [font italic=true]tori's[font italic=false] all yours, Illya."[lr]::
28855::$$$message_0207_0208_0002$$$::"Tori?"[lr]::
28856::$$$message_0207_0208_0003$$$::"Finale. Endmark. Basically, you're the climax of the show."::
28857::$$$message_0207_0209_0000$$$::"Okay![lr]::
28858::$$$message_0207_0209_0001$$$::What I want to say to my big brother is...!"::
28859::$$$message_0207_0210_0000$$$::"What I want to say is...!"::
28860::$$$message_0207_0211_0000$$$::"What I want to say is...!!!"[lr]::
28861::$$$message_0207_0211_0001$$$::She's freezing up. It's taking her too long to think of something.[lr]::
28862::$$$message_0207_0211_0002$$$::Illya ended up struggling the most with this round.[lr]::
28863::$$$message_0207_0211_0003$$$::...If things go on this way, we're liable to end up in an all-night battle of attrition, but someone smoothly steps in to interrupt.::
28864::$$$message_0207_0212_0000$$$::"'If I could choose the way I was born,[lr]::
28865::$$$message_0207_0212_0001$$$:: why would I be a little sister?'"::
28866::$$$message_0207_0213_0000$$$::"Pardon the clumsy interruption."[lr]::
28867::$$$message_0207_0213_0001$$$::The door slides closed, and I hear footsteps fade down the hallway.::
28868::$$$message_0207_0214_0000$$$::"Huh? Was Rider here all along?"[lr]::
28869::$$$message_0207_0214_0001$$$::"Hmm, she slipped in earlier to get coffee."[lr]::
28870::$$$message_0207_0214_0002$$$::"...I-I didn't even notice her."::
28871::$$$message_0207_0215_0000$$$::"Ack, she got us. The pears are gone!"[lr]::
28872::$$$message_0207_0215_0001$$$::Saber shouts as if accusing an enemy country of heinous crimes.[lr]::
28873::$$$message_0207_0215_0002$$$::"I thought we were going to share them."[lr]::
28874::$$$message_0207_0215_0003$$$::"Who ever said that!? That privilege is reserved for those who are involved with the contest!"[lr]::
28875::$$$message_0207_0215_0004$$$::Saber downs a cup of something that isn't water.::
28876::$$$message_0207_0216_0000$$$::"...Haaah.[lr]::
28877::$$$message_0207_0216_0001$$$::Oh well. That's your homework for next year, Illya."[lr]::
28878::$$$message_0207_0216_0002$$$::"Next year? W-[cacheimage storage=イリヤ08b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=イリヤ08b(中)]wait a second.[lr]::
28879::$$$message_0207_0216_0003$$$::It's still my turn! I'm gonna say it!"::
28880::$$$message_0207_0217_0000$$$::"It's okay, Illya. You don't have to rush."[lr]::
28881::$$$message_0207_0217_0001$$$::"Come on! Shirou, tell her!"[lr]::
28882::$$$message_0207_0217_0002$$$::"Is that your final answer?"[lr]::
28883::$$$message_0207_0217_0003$$$::"No! I haven't said it yet![lr]::
28884::$$$message_0207_0217_0004$$$::H-here I go..."::
28885::$$$message_0207_0218_0000$$$::"'I-I love you, Big Brother![lr]::
28886::$$$message_0207_0218_0001$$$:: Whether you become a balding uncle,[lr]::
28887::$$$message_0207_0218_0002$$$:: or a fat, lazy pig,[lr]::
28888::$$$message_0207_0218_0003$$$:: or a doddering old grandpa,[lr]::
28889::$$$message_0207_0218_0004$$$:: or even after you're in the grave![lr]::
28890::$$$message_0207_0218_0005$$$:: I'll always, always love you the most!'"::
28891::$$$message_0207_0219_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28892::$$$message_0207_0219_0001$$$::"..."::
28893::$$$message_0207_0220_0000$$$::"Well, talk about a straight ball..."[lr]::
28894::$$$message_0207_0220_0001$$$::"That was a furious, head-on rush. Even I got a little worried. This is Shirou we're talking about, you know."[lr]::
28895::$$$message_0207_0220_0002$$$::"You got something you want to say to me, Fuji-nee?"::
28896::$$$message_0207_0221_0000$$$::"Okay! Shirou, your final answer?"[lr]::
28897::$$$message_0207_0221_0001$$$::"Huh?"::
28898::$$$message_0207_0222_0000$$$::"Emiya?[lr]::
28899::$$$message_0207_0222_0001$$$::You'd better not give us any 'huh's,[lr]::
28900::$$$message_0207_0222_0002$$$::'let's all get along's,[lr]::
28901::$$$message_0207_0222_0003$$$::or 'I'm all about sharing the love' after dragging it out this long.[lr]::
28902::$$$message_0207_0222_0004$$$::You really think you can get away with some harem ending?"[lr]::
28903::$$$message_0207_0222_0005$$$::"I have to decide who wins?"::
28904::$$$message_0207_0223_0000$$$::"Yeah. Tell us who is the most Emiya-like little sister.[lr]::
28905::$$$message_0207_0223_0001$$$::If only so I can sleep soundly at night. Even Rider counts at this point."::
28906::$$$message_0207_0224_0000$$$::W-what the heck? Aren't we just back at square one?[lr]::
28907::$$$message_0207_0224_0001$$$::You've been enjoying this, haven't you, Tohsaka?::
28908::$$$message_0207_0225_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28909::$$$message_0207_0225_0001$$$::Illya's fists are clenched.[lr]::
28910::$$$message_0207_0225_0002$$$::She's desperate.[lr]::
28911::$$$message_0207_0225_0003$$$::...That gets me good.::
28912::$$$message_0207_0226_0000$$$::"...[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服08b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服08b(中)]Ugh...!"[lr]::
28913::$$$message_0207_0226_0001$$$::?[lr]::
28914::$$$message_0207_0226_0002$$$::Saber utters something and collapses to the floor.::
28915::$$$message_0207_0227_0000$$$::"Saber...!?"[lr]::
28916::$$$message_0207_0227_0001$$$::"Urgh...[lr]::
28917::$$$message_0207_0227_0002$$$::To think that Illya's Sister Force has grown so strong... Even I underestimated her..."::
28918::$$$message_0207_0228_0000$$$::"...Sakura, you should have felt it, too..."[lr]::
28919::$$$message_0207_0228_0001$$$::"Huh? Me too?"[lr]::
28920::$$$message_0207_0228_0002$$$::Saber glares up at Sakura from her supine position on the floor.::
28921::$$$message_0207_0229_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
28922::$$$message_0207_0229_0001$$$::"...Ngh...!?[lr]::
28923::$$$message_0207_0229_0002$$$::U-um, actually, I'm starting to get a tummyache..."::
28924::$$$message_0207_0230_0000$$$::"Illya... What have you...done...[lr]::
28925::$$$message_0207_0230_0001$$$::Hurgh..."[lr]::
28926::$$$message_0207_0230_0002$$$::Sakura flops over face-first onto the table.[lr]::
28927::$$$message_0207_0230_0003$$$::I'm a little worried by her expert acting.::
28928::$$$message_0207_0231_0000$$$::"TOTAL VICTORY! The evil is defeated![lr]::
28929::$$$message_0207_0231_0001$$$::Give me my big brother![lr]::
28930::$$$message_0207_0231_0002$$$::...Haaa!"[lr]::
28931::$$$message_0207_0231_0003$$$::As soon as she declares victory, Illya dives into my lap again.[lr]::
28932::$$$message_0207_0231_0004$$$::She smiles happily at the piles of corpses around the room.::
28933::$$$message_0207_0232_0000$$$::"Mrgh... You're someone to be feared, Illya.[lr]::
28934::$$$message_0207_0232_0001$$$::In one sense, that was the most ruthless attack of all."::
28935::$$$message_0207_0233_0000$$$::"As for my reward, I demand the granting of my right to wash Shirou's back in the bath!"[lr]::
28936::$$$message_0207_0233_0001$$$::"No."[lr]::
28937::$$$message_0207_0233_0002$$$::"Not possible."[lr]::
28938::$$$message_0207_0233_0003$$$::Saber and Sakura abruptly wake up.::
28939::$$$message_0207_0234_0000$$$::"Behave and stay dead, you zombies![lr]::
28940::$$$message_0207_0234_0001$$$::Reanimating is against the rules!"[lr]::
28941::$$$message_0207_0234_0002$$$::"You're one to talk!"::
28942::$$$message_0207_0235_0000$$$::Tohsaka stifles a laugh as the three little sisters start to argue again.[lr]::
28943::$$$message_0207_0235_0001$$$::Damn this Tohsaka production.::
28944::$$$message_0207_0236_0000$$$::"Hehe... I guess I can't really include Rider in this bunch."::
28945::$$$message_0207_0237_0000$$$::"Who said you could decide? Yeesh. Although Rider did just say that she's against being a little sister. But if I were born again, I'd probably want to be a little brother."::
28946::$$$message_0207_0238_0000$$$::"...!"[lr]::
28947::$$$message_0207_0238_0001$$$::"...!"[lr]::
28948::$$$message_0207_0238_0002$$$::"...!"[lr]::
28949::$$$message_0207_0238_0003$$$::"...!"::
28950::$$$message_0207_0239_0000$$$::"When I look at Issei... What are you nodding for, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
28951::$$$message_0207_0239_0001$$$::"Yep, I knew it."[lr]::
28952::$$$message_0207_0239_0002$$$::"Knew what?"::
28953::$$$message_0207_0240_0000$$$::"Aha, sorry. I've just always thought you have the color of a youngest sibling."[lr]::
28954::$$$message_0207_0240_0001$$$::"...Color? Uh..."[lr]::
28955::$$$message_0207_0240_0002$$$::"The color of your soul."::
28956::$$$message_0207_0241_0000$$$::"I think it's a wonderful color that only youngest siblings get."[lr]::
28957::$$$message_0207_0241_0001$$$::What the heck is she going on about in her cat ears mode?[lr]::
28958::$$$message_0207_0241_0002$$$::Still, I don't really have the luxury of considering the question.::
28959::$$$message_0207_0242_0000$$$::"Oh? A big sister?[lr]::
28960::$$$message_0207_0242_0001$$$::If you want me to be your big sister, I've got a few things to say."[lr]::
28961::$$$message_0207_0242_0002$$$::"...Huh?[lr]::
28962::$$$message_0207_0242_0003$$$::Uh, I wasn't trying to say anything about you..."::
28963::$$$message_0207_0243_0000$$$::"...Honestly, I don't think you have what it takes to be an older brother, Shirou."[lr]::
28964::$$$message_0207_0243_0001$$$::"That's dirty, Saber! Don't kick-start this conversation!"[lr]::
28965::$$$message_0207_0243_0002$$$::"Yeah.[lr]::
28966::$$$message_0207_0243_0003$$$::Being a little sister might be a stretch, but my big sisterness is..."::
28967::$$$message_0207_0244_0000$$$::"Hold it![lr]::
28968::$$$message_0207_0244_0001$$$::Being an older woman is nothing like being an older sister![lr]::
28969::$$$message_0207_0244_0002$$$::[font italic=true]I'm[font italic=false] his big sister!"[lr]::
28970::$$$message_0207_0244_0003$$$::"You're too fickle, Illya."[lr]::
28971::$$$message_0207_0244_0004$$$::"Waaah! But it's the truth!"::
28972::$$$message_0207_0245_0000$$$::"You're still going at it? Then it's time for me to settle this."[lr]::
28973::$$$message_0207_0245_0001$$$::"What? Is this a coup!?"[lr]::
28974::$$$message_0207_0245_0002$$$::"And look, all the players are here!"::
28975::$$$message_0207_0246_0000$$$::"Then, ladies and gentleman,[lr]::
28976::$$$message_0207_0246_0001$$$::I declare the start of the 1st Emiya Household Big Sister-King Championship!!!"::
28977::$$$message_0207_0247_0000$$$::And that's how an out-of-control party turned into an even more unhinged afterparty.[sestop time=2000 nowait=true][lr]::
28978::$$$message_0207_0247_0001$$$::The autumn nights are long.[lr]::
28979::$$$message_0207_0247_0002$$$::...I hope we can avoid an after-afterparty...::

